cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EmberEye in research, teaching, or a demo, please cite this repository."
title: "EmberEye: Harmonization of MODIS and VIIRS Hot Spots"
abstract: >-
  EmberEye is an Earth-observation intelligence platform that harmonizes 26
  years (2000-2026) of NASA MODIS and VIIRS active-fire detections into a
  single, cross-calibrated burning-activity record. It combines
  comparable-subset month-of-year transfer functions, spatiotemporal duplicate
  suppression, intra-VIIRS constellation normalization, leave-one-year-out
  climatology, and KD-tree episode clustering.
